{"unit_id":"Soulize__dsh-continue-on-limit-host#feature-1","repo":"Soulize/dsh-continue-on-limit-host","commit":"a4e2fea17b1022e04b8469cc7f15975dd2ebd6b0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-continue-on-limit-host 的功能「follow-up」：达到 max-tokens 时，插件从 turn-stopping 读取本轮结束原因并向下一 Turn 排入续写消息；已有待处理输入时会跳过。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:252-293","lib/index.js:583-608"]}
